{"seq":2,"slug":"mathematics","title":"四年级数学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"四年级数学-简介\">四年级数学 简介</h1><p>四年级数学是小学数学从基础运算迈向抽象思维的重要转折期，面向九至十岁已掌握万以内加减乘除运算的学生。这个阶段要求学生在数的认识上大幅拓展，初步接触分数与小数的概念，同时在图形与测量领域建立更为系统的空间观念。</p>\n<p>本内容共包含三个章节。第一章<strong>大数运算</strong>，从万以上大数的认读写入手，系统讲解多位数乘除法的竖式计算与估算方法，重点训练学生在复杂运算中保持计算准确性的能力，并通过实际情境题培养数感和合理判断结果的意识。第二章<strong>分数与小数</strong>，引入分数的基本含义与简单运算，讲解小数的意义、读写方法及加减运算，帮助学生理解整数与分数、小数之间的内在联系，为高年级的分数四则运算打下基础。第三章<strong>图形与测量</strong>，深入学习角的度量、三角形与平行四边形的特征与分类，系统训练面积计算方法，引导学生从直观操作走向逻辑推理。</p>\n<p>四年级数学学习需要格外注重计算习惯的规范化。建议每日坚持十至十五分钟的口算与竖式练习，在解应用题时养成先审题、再列式、后验算的良好习惯。分数和小数是全新概念，学习时多借助实物分割和数轴图来建立直觉理解。</p>\n<p>本内容适合四年级学生日常练习、家长同步辅导以及小学中年级数学教师教学参考。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"large-numbers-ops","title":"大数运算","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/large-numbers-ops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-digit-multiplication","title":"四年级数学 — 多位数乘法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/large-numbers-ops/multi-digit-multiplication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-digit-division","title":"四年级数学 — 多位数除法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/large-numbers-ops/multi-digit-division"},{"seq":3,"slug":"estimation-strategies","title":"四年级数学 — 估算策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/large-numbers-ops/estimation-strategies"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"fractions-decimals","title":"分数与小数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/fractions-decimals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"decimal-concepts","title":"四年级数学 — 小数的认识","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/fractions-decimals/decimal-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"decimal-operations","title":"四年级数学 — 小数加减法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/fractions-decimals/decimal-operations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fraction-decimal-conversion","title":"四年级数学 — 分数与小数互化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/fractions-decimals/fraction-decimal-conversion"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"geometry-measurement","title":"几何与测量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/geometry-measurement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"angles-classification","title":"四年级数学 — 角的分类与度量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/geometry-measurement/angles-classification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"parallelogram-trapezoid","title":"四年级数学 — 平行四边形与梯形","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/geometry-measurement/parallelogram-trapezoid"},{"seq":3,"slug":"area-calculation","title":"四年级数学 — 面积计算方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-4/mathematics/geometry-measurement/area-calculation"}]}]}